# Who is asked to review what. GitHub reads the first CODEOWNERS it finds in
# .github/, the repository root or docs/; this is the one. Patterns follow
# gitignore rules and the LAST matching line wins, so the general owner comes
# first and the folders that need a second look come after it.
#
# Code owners work in a private repository only on GitHub Pro or above; in a
# public one they work on every plan. docs/MAINTAINERS.md has the rest.

